{"id":"600833","name":"华夫饼","author":"灵的厨坊","authorId":"5892322","desc":"","cover":"images/600833/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"蛋糕粉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"椰子粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"糖","amount":"30g"},{"name":"食物油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蛋清蛋黄分离。","img":"images/600833/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蛋清里加入20克糖。","img":"images/600833/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"打发至硬性发泡，就是拉起不会掉落就可以。","img":"images/600833/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"克蛋糕粉，10克糖，一包椰子粉，加入蛋黄中，","img":"images/600833/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"注入适量的清水，调成糊状。","img":"images/600833/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入打好的蛋清。","img":"images/600833/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"调成均匀的面糊。","img":"images/600833/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"刷上食用油，上下面都刷。","img":"images/600833/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入。","img":"images/600833/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"我用的是三明治早餐机，2、3分钟熟了会自动断电。","img":"images/600833/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"很香","img":"images/600833/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"😝","img":"images/600833/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"😝","img":"images/600833/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛、打蛋器\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}